.git
.env

# cynea/ and *.py are NOT excluded any more: api/index.py imports the
# FastAPI app out of cynea/, so the package has to ship with the build.
# Excluding them is what left the API unreachable while the marketing site
# deployed fine — the console fell back to localhost and nobody outside
# this machine could sign in.
#
# cynea_africa/ ships too, and must: cynea/agent_loader.py imports the four
# persona modules out of it, and those imports are wrapped in try/except so
# a missing package does not raise — it just leaves _PERSONAS empty, and
# then every POST /agents is rejected with "Unknown persona 'kwame'".
# A silent failure is the reason this is spelled out rather than trimmed.
#
# The one piece that genuinely stays behind is the dashboard preview: 5,560
# lines of hardcoded sample callers that nothing on the server imports.
cynea_africa/dashboard/preview.py
local_setup/
tests/
examples/
tools/
node_modules/
compress_videos.py
optimize_images.py
test_elevenlabs.py

# Orphan heavy assets — no longer referenced in any HTML.
# Kept on disk for archival but excluded from the Vercel build.
assets/hero-bg.mp4
assets/african-pattern.svg

# Full-resolution image masters kept by optimize_images.py.
# Archival only — the site serves the .webp/.jpg derivatives.
assets/_originals/

# Videos not placed in the current design. Kept on disk, out of the build.
assets/Adinkra Hotel.mp4
assets/Analytics.mp4
assets/Hero-bg 2.mp4
assets/Telephony.mp4
assets/world.mp4

# Caption sources. The page fetches only captions.page.json; the full
# transcript set and the cached Groq responses are build inputs.
assets/segments/captions.json
assets/segments/_groq_raw/

# The four raw takes. These are the input to tools/build_conversations.py —
# one speaker each, recorded alone — and the page only ever serves what that
# stitches out of them (assets/*_full_conversation.mp3). Kept on disk so the
# conversations can be re-cut; 3.2 MB that no visitor would ever fetch.
assets/kwame_agent.mp3
assets/kwame_caller.mp3
assets/amina_agent.mp3
assets/amina_caller.mp3
